git2pkg (0.2.0~alpha.36) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build in the host distribution's own version for glibc compatibility.
  * Relabel the workspace mount for SELinux hosts.
  * Heal an outdated rustc (lock file version 4) and an outdated g++.
  * Fix ABI misclassification and CMake module verification.
  * Never stage badges as the app icon; no duplicate log files.

 -- Hakan Yalçın <hyalcin70@github.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:10:00 +0100

git2pkg (0.2.0~alpha.35) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Optional prebuilt builder images per distribution.
  * Native packaging through the project's own debian/ or *.spec.
  * CMake installs under /usr, versions from git tags, license detection.
  * Clear failure diagnoses and an in-run toolchain heal.
  * Shallow submodules, direct DT_NEEDED dependencies for Arch.

